            "detailed_description": "<strong><br>The Legend of Dark Witch is a 2D platform action game. <br>Zizou can learn new attacks by defeating bosses. <br>She will need every one of those attacks if she is going to save the world. <br><br>-A magical world beautifully depicted through in-game graphics. <br>-Diverse levels that provide a fair challenge. <br>-Additional bonuses that reward those who replay the game. <br>-3 difficulty modes. </strong>",
            "about_the_game": "<strong><br>The Legend of Dark Witch is a 2D platform action game. <br>Zizou can learn new attacks by defeating bosses. <br>She will need every one of those attacks if she is going to save the world. <br><br>-A magical world beautifully depicted through in-game graphics. <br>-Diverse levels that provide a fair challenge. <br>-Additional bonuses that reward those who replay the game. <br>-3 difficulty modes. </strong>",
